WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.568
We are going to take the train. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:12.984
We find our platform on the big board. The board shows the time and the platform number.

3
00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:17.688
We stand behind the yellow line and wait for the train.

4
00:00:17.688 --> 00:00:23.784
The train arrives and the doors open. People get off first.

5
00:00:23.784 --> 00:00:28.872
We find our seat, or a free seat, and sit down.

6
00:00:28.872 --> 00:00:35.568
A voice or a screen tells us the stops. We listen for ours.

7
00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:40.512
When our stop comes, we take our bag and get off.

8
00:00:40.512 --> 00:00:46.320
We follow the signs for the exit. The journey is done.

9
00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:54.528
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

